                        "entry_id": "e6803cc2-0f99-30d0-b6bb-5a69a5adfe52",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A small knobbed structure in some two-winged insects, one of a pair that are flapped rapidly and function as accelerometers to maintain stability in flight."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "97c95c99-441a-4300-a563-da732ac010ac",
                                "sense_id": "4eef036e-baf4-315b-ba35-b67123abf54e",
                                "text": "Whenever the fly changes direction at an angle to the hinge, the shaking bends the halteres at their base and turns them into a gyroscope."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
